{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-grove-sobha-realty-sobha-sanctuary","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1398,"crm_id":"819","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"The Grove","slug":"the-grove-sobha-realty-sobha-sanctuary","display_address":"Sobha Sanctuary","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Sobha Realty","price":3900000,"display_price":"3.9M","lattitude":25.1105625,"longitude":55.2492376,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Grove at Sobha Sanctuary is an exclusive low-rise villa enclave by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-sobha-realty/\">Sobha Realty</a>, set within Dubai’s landmark nature-led master community in Dubailand.</p><p>Designed as a private residential cluster, The Grove offers expansive<strong> 4-, 5-, and 6-bedroom estate villas,</strong> surrounded by landscaped parks, shaded pathways, and a calm blue-green network that promotes wellness-driven living.</p><p>Homes at The Grove are thoughtfully positioned for privacy, with direct access to cycling tracks, pedestrian trails, and open green corridors. The architecture reflects Sobha’s signature craftsmanship, featuring smart-home readiness, private courtyards, large terraces, and select layouts with private pools and lifts.</p><p>Residents enjoy seamless access to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/sobha-sanctuary-sobha-realty-dubailand/\">Sobha Sanctuary</a>’s central park, wellness loops, resort-style water features, and lifestyle amenities, creating a refined environment where nature, space, and long-term livability come together effortlessly.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_4f18f