e":null,"image":null},{"id":36188,"url":null,"text":"Kids splash zones & play areas","type":null,"image":null},{"id":36189,"url":null,"text":"Co-working spaces & social hubs","type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1435,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"The Grove","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Sobha Realty","project_location":"Dubailand"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/mobile_0c04c32711.jpg","hash":"mobile_0c04c32711","name":"The Grove mobile.jpg"},"seo":{"id":2221,"metaTitle":"The Grove at Sobha Sanctuary | Luxury Villas in Dubailand","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Discover The Grove at Sobha Sanctuary, luxury estate villas in Dubailand with nature-led living, wellness amenities, and strong long-term value."},"more_info":[{"id":9470,"answer":"<p>The Grove Villas form an exclusive estate enclave within Sobha Sanctuary, thoughtfully planned as a low-density residential cluster. The community offers expansive villa living set within landscaped green corridors, combining architectural refinement, privacy, and a wellness-focused lifestyle designed for long-term family living.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is The Grove at Sobha Sanctuary?"},{"id":9471,"answer":"<p>The Grove Dubai is situated within the Sobha Sanctuary master community in Dubailand, a strategically positioned district offering smooth access to major highways and key destinations across the city. The location balances connectivity with a calm, nature-led residential environment.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Where is The Grove located?"},{"id":9472,"answer":"<p>The Grove features a curated selection of Sobha Sanctuary estate villas Dubai, offering 4, 5, and 6-bedroom layouts. Each villa is designed with generous proportions, modern planning, and premium specifications that support comfort, privacy, and refined everyday living.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of villas are avail